      "managementDiversity": "<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Begin with quiz expectations clearly explained.<br data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1265\">\nKeep transitions between quiz and lesson structured.<br data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1320\">\nPause slides regularly for chunked notes.<br data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1364\">\nUse visual examples to support understanding.<br data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1412\">\nSupport students with key vocabulary and examples.</span>",
