      "assessmentFeedback": "<h1 data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3737\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 13px;\">Teacher conferencing checks readiness for submission.</span></h1>\n<p data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3845\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Observation checks participation and collaboration.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3920\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Debate planning and scripts show understanding of globalisation concepts.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3977\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Teacher provides verbal feedback throughout the lesson.</span></p>",
