      "differentiation": "<p data-start=\"4135\" data-end=\"4219\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Support:<br data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4146\">\nBreak tasks into smaller steps.<br data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4180\">\nProvide topic suggestions and guidance.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4279\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Core:<br data-start=\"4226\" data-end=\"4229\">\nChoose indicator, assign roles and begin research.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"4281\" data-end=\"4366\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Extension:<br data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4294\">\nResearch deeper economic analysis and stronger data visualisation ideas.</span></p>",
